; -*- mode: lisp -*-
; ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
; What every syringe_packing variant shares: the VAB-industrial `syringe`
; export, the convention it was staged under, the scenery the loader used to
; add in Python -- the instrument tray and the invisible floor it is stood
; on, the room dressing -- and the bare look every reported number was taken
; under. A variant's document says what differs: its objects, its budget, its
; goal, where the tray and the syringes stand (poses/<variant>.json) and, for
; a layout sweep, which shifted workcell its foreign-robot hosts stand in.
; ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
(define (suite syringe_packing)
  (:language Post a single-use syringe through the aperture of a sealed sharps box (Franka Panda))
  (:staging
    ; `sharps_vab_industrial@v1`, not `vab_industrial@v1`: the same convention
    ; in every field except the camera rig, which reads at 1280x960 where
    ; tool_sort reads 640x480 -- the detection resolution the insertion
    ; planner depends on and the reported numbers were measured at.
    (:profile sharps_vab_industrial@v1)
    (:export vab_syringe_packing/tray_pair)
    ; No (:collider ...) clause, deliberately -- but not for the reason it once
    ; had. Every syringe now collides on the CoACD decomposition of the mesh it
    ; draws (records.py's SYRINGE_COLLISION_PATHS, reached through the `syringe`
    ; record's own build), so there is nothing here for a blanket collider word
    ; to say. The export's authored box, which this replaces, was 23.6 mm across
    ; its whole 150 mm -- the mesh's own bound -- so the pads closed on a slab
    ; and never reached the 11 mm barrel. The export's own free body is dropped
    ; per document, (:export ... (:strip-free-bodies true)): it carries that box,
    ; and a body cannot hold two opinions about its collider.
    ; One arm, and the arena arrives with its robot welded in.
    (:arms 1)
    (:monolithic true)
    ; The graphs were written and measured with the tool servoed at about
    ; 0.12 m/s (0.4 of the OSC law's 0.31 m/s cruise); stated here so it does
    ; not depend on the host. A servo turn used to span two or three simulator
    ; steps with the setpoint law advanced once per turn, so the speed every
    ; leg was tuned against was whatever the machine gave; the servo now
    ; counts every step, and this keeps the paper's graphs at the speed the
    ; paper measured them at.
    (:servo-speed-mps 0.12)
  )
  ; Scenery every variant stands in. The tray is drawn as VAB-industrial's own
  ; mesh and collides as an invisible floor slab and four walls (records.py),
  ; because the mesh's convex hull would fill the pan solid; the dressing_* pieces are
  ; visual-only room furniture so the record-time video reads as a room
  ; (assets/scenery.py says why each is where it is).
  (:fixtures
    syringe_tray - instrument_tray
    syringe_tray_floor - instrument_tray_floor
    ; The four walls the drawn tray did not have. Until these the mesh was
    ; decorative and the floor slab was the whole of the collision, so a syringe
    ; pushed sideways left the pan straight through a wall a camera can see.
    syringe_tray_wall_xpos - instrument_tray_wall_xpos
    syringe_tray_wall_xneg - instrument_tray_wall_xneg
    syringe_tray_wall_ypos - instrument_tray_wall_ypos
    syringe_tray_wall_yneg - instrument_tray_wall_yneg
    dressing_floor - sharps_dressing_floor
    dressing_wall_west - sharps_dressing_wall_west
    dressing_wall_north - sharps_dressing_wall_north
    dressing_pedestal - sharps_dressing_pedestal
  )
  (:artifacts
    ; A bare RenderSpec, deliberately: each backend's own defaults, which is
    ; the light every reported number for this suite was measured under.
    ; assets/look.py records what the house room's fill light did to the
    ; wrist-view masks.
    (:render "look:BARE")
  )
  (:provenance
    (:source "AUTOLab-GaP-NVIDIA-Collaboration/VAB-industrial ToolSortPickPlace, robosuite 1.4.0,
              MuJoCo 3.3.3, seed 0, `put_the_syringe_in_the_sharps_box` problem. Regions and goals
              transcribed into the documents beside this file; see their headers for what
              'reconstructed' means and why a round trip through them proves less than it looks.")
  )
)
